# The sidebar's search keeps the keyboard the reader handed it.
#
# f6aacf3 ranked two claimants -- the escape ladder's own surfaces, and the
# composer -- and the sidebar's search is neither. It is a text field that is on
# screen in every frame the sidebar is unfolded, so presence says nothing about
# it, and no flag in the surface set describes it. The composer therefore still
# counted as the keyboard's holder while the reader was typing a query, and the
# seam that puts a yielded caret BACK in the composer took it out of the search
# box the moment the surface it had yielded to went away. Everything typed after
# that landed in the draft behind the sidebar, and the query stopped growing
# with no sign that anything had moved.
#
# The order is the whole assertion, and it takes three steps to set up: the
# composer is claimed first, a surface is raised over it so the composer yields,
# and the search field is claimed while that surface is up. The find bar is that
# surface because it is the one an ordinary chord raises WITHOUT covering the
# sidebar -- a modal sheet swallows the click that would reach the search field,
# so it cannot state this case at all. Closing the surface is the moment under
# test: the composer is entitled to its caret back only when nothing else is
# holding one.
#
# The last arm is the counter-case in the same run. A click on the composer IS a
# claim and the newest claim wins, so the draft grows again -- and the query
# stays exactly where the reader left it, which is what says the keyboard moved
# rather than the text.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":760,"open_tabs":["t2"],"active_tab":"t2","theme":"dark"}

require_thread t2
wait_frames 20

focus_ui composer_reply_input
wait_frames 10
type "mine"
wait_frames 12
expect_input_text composer_reply_input "mine"

key CTRL+F
wait_frames 16
expect_input_text find_input ""

click_ui sb_search
wait_frames 14
type "abc"
wait_frames 14
expect_input_text sb_search_text "abc"
expect_input_text composer_reply_input "mine"

key CTRL+F
wait_frames 20
type "def"
wait_frames 16
expect_input_text sb_search_text "abcdef"
expect_input_text composer_reply_input "mine"

click_ui composer_reply_input
wait_frames 12
type " again"
wait_frames 14
expect_input_text composer_reply_input "mine again"
expect_input_text sb_search_text "abcdef"
